Fluxyr Agent includes code extracted and adapted from Fluxyr (fluxyr-work2),
commit 019eceb0b82ccc955280671a6813ba602cc70c0a, at the owner's request.
Preserved modules include SyntheticBrain, model adapters, tool batch policies,
human decision gate, web content extraction, TechDoc and vault encryption.

The frontend incorporates and adapts Scificn UI components published for
copy-paste integration at https://www.scificn.dev/ by baxy5:
Button, Badge, Panel, Input, Textarea, Dialog and Spinner. Retrieved 2026-10-07.
Theme source revision: 8b06737dcfbf38c55236b7a6b77f15070c5bb3fd.
Registry file digests are recorded in frontend/src/ui/scificn-source.json.
Local adaptations include Fluxyr design tokens, locally hosted fonts,
accessible dialog close labeling and the branded rounded symbol.
